-- Generated by cmd/scrape -only item -emit-names on 2026-10-15.
-- Adds item.display_name and backfills it for 1864 items.
--
-- item.name is PokeAPI's slug, and slugs lose information: "kings-rock" is
-- King's Rock, "pokeblock-case" is Pokéblock Case, and the Z-Crystals are
-- "<name>-z--held". Names are PokeAPI's English name, or Showdown's for the
-- Showdown-only items, or a title-cased slug where neither exists.

